<title>USA: Aydin says Taylor resigned as president.</title>
<headline>Aydin says Taylor resigned as president.</headline>
<dateline>HORSHAM, Pa. 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aydin Corp said on Friday Donald Taylor had resigned as president.</p>
<p>In a brief statement, the company said Taylor left to pursue other interests. Taylor also resigned as a member of the board.</p>
</text>
